      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is one of the Bazel 8 follow-up adjustments mentioned in the commit message, specifically “Fix Prolog tests under Bazel runfiles.”\n\nBazel 8 changed the runfiles layout for external repositories. Paths like `external/\u003crepo\u003e` no longer resolve the same way under `_main/external`, so the Prolog test wrapper needs to normalize them relative to `TEST_SRCDIR`.\n\nThis script change does that by remapping external/... paths to the Bazel 8 runfiles layout, handling paths that still point into _main/external/..., and resolving Java home-style paths to the actual Java binary.\n\nWithout this adjustment, the Prolog tests fail under Bazel 8 because the Java/toolchain paths no longer match the new runfiles structure.",
      "parentUuid": "6063f964_322deef6",
      "revId": "ee7894fd161150e5f338c1a999c55272089c9ab7",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
